dsh-tavily-search README · Manual alternative (no `dsh` CLI)：Add the package to the target profile's `package.json` by hand and run
`pnpm install` there:

```json
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-tavily-search": "0.1.0" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["@deepseek-ai/dsh-base", "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app", "dsh-tavily-search"] } }
}

`pnpm install` in the profile materializes it, and the harness applies
`cordis.patch.yml` because the package is listed in `dsh.profile.bundles`.
